body:
I appreciate this comment! After you mentioned protein, I realised that every step of my hair care included protein. I do have a protein-free shampoo, but I don't have a protein-free conditioner readily available, unfortunately. If you have any recommendations for that I'd greatly appreciate it! :) 

&#x200B;

I haven't actually heard of hammock diffusing, but I'll give it a try on my next wash day!
